SJ0002S3002/ADOPTED
Delete the Gierau third reading amendment (SJ0002S3001/A) entirely and further
amend as follows:
Page 3-after line 22 Insert:
"WHEREAS, some of the surface resources held by the United States within the
state of Wyoming are designated as national parks, national monuments, national
forests, wilderness areas, historic sites, recreation areas and other nationally
designated areas that are open to the public and provide immeasurable benefits
to the citizens of Wyoming and the United States; and".
